          "media": {
            "duration": 1502,
            "fileSize": 24297120
          },
          "description": "The Soundtrekkers are amazed to learn that Haddock, a type of fish in the North Sea, create drumming sounds by vibrating their swim bladders! They immediately head out to capture the sounds for the latest episode of Soundtrek, but when they arrive, their mic picks up a different sound. Upon investigation, they discover the most brutish and reckless of all villains, Flounder Pounder, who uses an oversized rubber flounder to create destruction in her wake. When she threatens to use her fake fish to pulverize the Soundtrekkers sub, they consult the Seven Cs Solver app, which informs them that CRITICAL THINKING could be the answer to their latest troubles. The Soundtrekkers must show Flounder Pounder how to make better choices, and not destroy things simply for the fun of it!",
